3.3.1 Gambling of any form within the campus;
3.3.2 Deliberate shouting, giggling, conducting boisterous and disruptive conversations, running along the corridors and creating any noise that disturbs ongoing classes;
3.3.3 Public display of affection within the school premises which offend the sensibilities of fellow students, faculty and administrative officials or which may be deemed by them as improper, vulgar, repulsive or immoral;
3.3.4 Cheating in various forms such as:
3.3.4.1 Deliberately looking at a neighbor’s examination papers
3.3.4.2 Copying from or allowing another to copy from one’s examination papers; 3.3.4.3 Taking pictures of examination papers;
3.3.4.4 Talking with one another during exams without permission;
3.3.4.5 Unauthorized possession of notes or any material relative to the examination;
3.3.4.6 Passing as one’s own work, any assigned report, term paper, case analysis, reaction paper, and the like which are copied from others;
3.3.5 Use of somebody else’s ID card or allowing others to use his/her ID;
3.3.6 Deliberate disruption of any school function or activity;
3.3.7 Vandalism or destruction of school property;
3.3.8 Display or distribution of pornographic materials within the university;
3.3.9 Entering or being in the school premises under the influence of liquor and/or drugs; 3.3.10 Conducting, initiating, or joining unofficial or unauthorized field trips or events under the guise or presuming to be a part of the academic requirement;
3.3.11 Use of school premises and/or facilities for meetings and assemblies without a prior permit;
3.3.12 Committing acts inside and outside the campus that affect the good name of the University and/or one’s status as a student of the university;
3.3.13 Gross act of disrespect, in word or in deed, which tends to place any member of the faculty, administration, or non-teaching staff in ridicule or in contempt;
3.3.14 Solicitation of money, donation, or contributions in cash or kind without the prior approval of the school;
3.3.15 Such other acts as may herein be determined from time to time by the Student Disciplinary Committee.

