3.3.1 Generally accepted government accounting principles in accordance with the Philippine Public Sector Accounting Standards (PPSAS);
3.3.2 Accrual Basis of accounting in accordance with the PPSAS;
3.3.3 Budget Basis for presentation of budget information in the financial statements (FSs) in accordance with PPSAS 24;
3.3.4 Revised Chart of Accounts (RCA) prescribed by Commission on Audit (COA);
3.3.5 Double Entry Bookkeeping;
3.3.6 Financial Statements based on accounting and budgetary records; and
3.3.7 Fund Cluster accounting.
